<%- include('partials/header',{title:'Overview'}) %>
<section class="hero">
  <div class="container hero-grid">
    <div><span class="eyebrow">KENYA · 2027 GENERAL ELECTION</span><h1>Look beyond the headlines.<br><em>Follow the evidence.</em></h1><p class="hero-copy">Explore published opinion polls, economic indicators, development commitments and what people say about the direction of the country.</p><div class="d-flex flex-wrap gap-2"><a class="btn btn-light btn-lg" href="/polls">Explore published polls →</a><a class="btn btn-outline-light btn-lg" href="/methodology">How we assess evidence</a></div><p class="hero-note">Independent information dashboard · No candidate endorsement or winner prediction</p></div>
    <div class="hero-panel"><div class="panel-top">● EVIDENCE DASHBOARD <span class="ms-auto">2026</span></div><div class="hero-stat"><span>Economic context</span><strong>4.6%</strong><small>Kenya real GDP growth in 2025 · KNBS</small></div><div class="mini-divider"></div><div class="hero-stat"><span>Public opinion</span><strong>Multiple views</strong><small>Surveys differ by date, question and method.</small></div><div class="mini-divider"></div><div class="hero-stat"><span>Development record</span><strong>Track delivery</strong><small>Compare announcements with budgets, results and audits.</small></div></div>
  </div>
</section>
<% if(opinionStats){ %><%- include('partials/opinion-results',{opinionStats,compact:true}) %><% } %>
<%- include('partials/development-gallery',{developmentGallery,compact:true}) %>
<section class="section"><div class="container"><div class="section-head"><div><span class="eyebrow dark">THE BIG PICTURE</span><h2>Four lenses, one clearer view</h2></div><p>Each metric tells only part of the story. Read the context and source before drawing conclusions.</p></div><div class="row g-3"><% [['◉','Published polls','Read dated survey results with sample, fieldwork, method and caveats.','/polls','Compare poll snapshots'],['↗','Economy','GDP, sector activity, jobs, prices and public-finance pressures.','/economy','Review indicators'],['⌂','Development','Track reported initiatives and evidence needed to assess delivery.','/developments','Review commitments'],['☷','Public voice','Share your views in a short, voluntary civic survey.','/have-your-say','Have your say']].forEach(c=>{ %><div class="col-md-6 col-lg-3"><a class="feature-card" href="<%= c[3] %>"><span class="feature-icon"><%= c[0] %></span><h3><%= c[1] %></h3><p><%= c[2] %></p><span class="card-link"><%= c[4] %> →</span></a></div><% }) %></div></div></section>
<section class="section section-soft"><div class="container"><div class="section-head"><div><span class="eyebrow dark">ECONOMIC SNAPSHOT</span><h2>Numbers need context</h2></div><a class="text-link" href="/economy">All indicators →</a></div><div class="row g-3"><% economy.forEach(item=>{ %><div class="col-sm-6 col-lg-3"><div class="metric-card"><span class="metric-period"><%= item.period %></span><strong><%= item.value %></strong><h3><%= item.label %></h3><p><%= item.detail %></p><a href="<%= item.source %>" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Source ↗</a></div></div><% }) %></div></div></section>
<section class="section"><div class="container"><div class="section-head"><div><span class="eyebrow dark">PUBLIC OPINION</span><h2>What surveys have reported</h2></div><span class="tag">Dated findings</span></div><div class="row g-3"><% survey.forEach(item=>{ %><div class="col-md-6"><article class="opinion-card"><span class="date-label"><%= item.date %></span><h3><%= item.title %></h3><p><%= item.summary %></p><a href="<%= item.source %>" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Read reporting and context ↗</a></article></div><% }) %></div><p class="fine-print mt-3">These are attributed findings from specific surveys, not a complete measure of all Kenyan views.</p></div></section>
<section class="cta"><div class="container cta-inner"><div><span class="eyebrow dark">CITIZEN INPUT</span><h2>What issue matters most to you?</h2><p>Share your priorities and optional presidential preference without providing your name.</p></div><a class="btn btn-dark btn-lg" href="/have-your-say">Take the short survey →</a></div></section>
<%- include('partials/footer') %>
